        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-26T15:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Shattered timelines also means alternate timelines.</p><p>Who knows, maybe in one reality Jim and the Rat have their epic showdown, the rat dies but Jim is dying too, but the virus mutates him and he ends up being the rat, only in his last moments as himself does he realize that it was himself he fought. &nbsp;I could definitely see the ratness being passed on like a legacy powers style werebeast, only in this case to himself in a big old time loop.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
