      {
        "id": 74041,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-27T15:19:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Greywind\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/48/2006_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Greywind:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>He didn't say Plague Rat. He said the Rat Beasts. The Beasts have spinal spurs.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You know…given the nature of Voss's army, the Final Wasteland timeline could be very, very appealing to our intergalactic warlord. I wonder if there is any connection here. KNYFE's bio mentions special attention being paid to certain timelines over others. /shrug</p>",
