        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-27T20:14:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Anyone else notice the two visual conflics on 'Shadowy Ambush' In PR's deck?</p><p>-Chrono's non-bitten off arm is wrong, supposed to be his right side(Not their first fight since he has the dart gun given to him by CON).</p><p>-His hat is blue(It's supposed to be brown/tan).</p><p>I'd chalk these up to just artistic changes for a character that hadn't been visually finished yet, but it's interesting to see the process...</p>",
